[patterns/application/micro-frontend/PTN-APP-MFE-001-authentication-modernization-pattern.md#phase-3-backend-api-integration-weeks-5-6]

#### Phase 3: Backend API Integration (Weeks 5-6)

1. **Configure JWT Bearer Authentication**

   ```csharp
   // Startup.cs
   services.AddAuthentication(JwtBearerDefaults.AuthenticationScheme)
       .AddJwtBearer(options =>
       {
           options.Authority = Configuration["Auth:Authority"];
           options.Audience = "api";
           options.RequireHttpsMetadata = true;

           // PHI access audit logging
           options.Events = new JwtBearerEvents
           {
               OnTokenValidated = context =>
               {
                   var logger = context.HttpContext.RequestServices.GetRequiredService<IAuditLogger>();
                   logger.LogPhiAccess(new PhiAccessEvent
                   {
                       UserId = context.Principal.FindFirst("sub")?.Value,
                       Resource = context.HttpContext.Request.Path,
                       Timestamp = DateTime.UtcNow
                   });
                   return Task.CompletedTask;
               }
           };
       });
   ```

2. **Protect Controllers**

   ```csharp
   [Authorize] // Requires valid JWT
   [ApiController]
   [Route("api/[controller]")]
   public class ClaimsController : ControllerBase
   {
       [HttpGet]
       public async Task<IActionResult> GetClaims()
       {
           var userId = User.FindFirst("sub")?.Value;
           var claims = await _claimService.GetClaimsForUser(userId);
           return Ok(claims);
       }
   }
   ```

