[patterns/application/micro-frontend/PTN-APP-MFE-001-authentication-modernization-pattern.md#phase-4-dual-authentication-support-weeks-7-8]

#### Phase 4: Dual Authentication Support (Weeks 7-8)

1. **NGINX Routing (Forms Auth + OAuth2)**

   ```nginx
   # /etc/nginx/conf.d/dual-auth.conf
   server {
       listen 443 ssl;
       server_name enterprise.gainwell.com;

       # React SPA (OAuth2 authentication)
       location /spa/ {
           proxy_pass http://react-spa:3000/;
           proxy_set_header Authorization $http_authorization;
       }

       # Legacy ASP.NET (Forms Authentication)
       location /legacy/ {
           proxy_pass http://aspnet-app:8080/;
           proxy_set_header Cookie $http_cookie;
       }

       # API Gateway checks both auth types
       location /api/ {
           auth_request /auth-check;
           proxy_pass http://api-gateway:5000/;
       }

       # Internal auth check endpoint
       location /auth-check {
           internal;
           js_content checkAuth;
       }
   }
   ```

